{"overview":"«فندِن سِنکی» آخرین کلمات پدربزرگ کاری بود و اکنون مأموریت اوست. DARK MACHINE، بازی eSport جدید و جذاب، اقتصاد ژاپن را دگرگون کرد. قدرتمندترین بازیکن با عنوان سِنکی آن را در اختیار دارد. حالا، در سِنکی هفتم، کاری برای ملاقات نهایی و به دست گرفتن عنوان می‌جنگد؛ آیا می‌تواند در این رقابت پیروز شود؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"“Find Senki,” those were the final words of Kairi’s grandfather and now his mission. DARK MACHINE, a new and captivating eSport game, transformed Japan’s economy. The most powerful player controls it with the title Senki. Now, on the seventh Senki, Kairi plays to finally meet them and ultimately take claim. Will he be able to hold his own, though?","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":11,"y":2026,"poster":""}],"episodes":11,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"小野賢章","role":"Kairi (voice)","photo":"/wUYJ3HIeygHfh4rAqupE4RPoG3W.jpg","en":"Kensho Ono"},{"name":"沢城みゆき","role":"Rudora (voice)","photo":"/11mGqwpmu8CoEy1YJgabj2g7MIv.jpg","en":"Miyuki Sawashiro"},{"name":"内山昂輝","role":"Shinn (voice)","photo":"/sllSm3iZZWVLTBrDZQRtWrZUfEj.jpg","en":"Koki Uchiyama"},{"name":"杉山里穂","role":"Bran (voice)","photo":"/rPVn4cInZVECBWhoHozERc8XTTj.jpg","en":"Riho Sugiyama"},{"name":"会沢紗弥","role":"Isana (voice)","photo":"/3QoVKl1w7uBMf5ivJ4MccYkt4zR.jpg","en":"Saya Aizawa"},{"name":"中村悠一","role":"Ajima (voice)","photo":"/wb8behVKjBHX9XXrEydvNINCYwH.jpg","en":"Yuichi Nakamura"},{"name":"興津和幸","role":"Myojin (voice)","photo":"/vgyaK5dAxhvzAi6LJM3ZyaJd4mJ.jpg","en":"Kazuyuki Okitsu"},{"name":"ریوتا سوزوکی","role":"Ryo (voice)","photo":"/4Xq18mQttuW2yfRCflnWoU7UqQ5.jpg","en":"Ryota Suzuki"},{"name":"中村源太","role":"Kinji (voice)","photo":"/bl3pu2fsaNfHqnZQSDugY4V1CE0.jpg","en":"Genta Nakamura"},{"name":"堀金蒼平","role":"Hiru (voice)","photo":"/7JftC3BBrKAfK0MtcbRVELLOyfo.jpg","en":"Souhei Horikane"},{"name":"綿貫竜之介","role":"Nyudo (voice)","photo":"/cJBw6vHWD4u9dAdBFA7CUqKUj9A.jpg"